aim@aim-PowerEdge-T620:~/.config/oxide$ oxide certificate create --help
------------------------------------
This certificate is automatically used by the Oxide Control plane to serve external connections.

Usage: oxide certificate create [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --cert <CERT-FILE>
          path to a PEM-formatted file containing a public certificate chain

      --description <description>


      --key <KEY-FILE>
          path to a PEM-formatted file containing a private key

      --name <name>


      --service <service>
          The service using this certificate

          [possible values: external_api]

      --json-body <JSON-FILE>
          Path to a file that contains the full json body.

      --json-body-template
          XXX

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

Global Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>
          Configuration profile to use for commands
